de, image, archive, document or executable), with a badge for symbolic links. The footer reports how many folders and files the current directory holds and how many entries are selected.","f":["<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":41295,"e":41385,"k":"block","t":"Drag and dropKTPH000","f":["<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#drag-and-drop\" title=\"Permanent link\">&para;</a>"]},{"s":41394,"e":41740,"k":"block","t":"Drag files KTPH001outKTPH002 of the browser onto another application to copy them, and drag files KTPH003intoKTPH004 the browser to copy or move them into a folder. Dropping onto a folder targets that folder; dropping elsewhere targets the current directory. Name clashes are resolved with a KTPH000 suffix rather than overwriting.","f":["<code>(2)</code>","<strong>","</strong>","<strong>","</strong>"]},{"s":42618,"e":42633,"k":"text","t":"\n  Back to top\n","f":[]},{"s":42876,"e":42917,"k":"text","t":"MIT-licensed · Developed by Daniel Mengel","f":[]},{"s":42963,"e":42975,"k":"text","t":"\n    korTTY ","f":[]},{"s":42983,"e":42990,"k":"text","t":"v2.11.0","f":[]}]}